WEBVTT

00:26:58.916 --> 00:27:03.396
we see ourselves as wanting
to make our data available

00:27:03.436 --> 00:27:05.316
to more and more researchers.

00:27:05.796 --> 00:27:08.676
So we want to collaborate,
and we do collaborate,

00:27:08.716 --> 00:27:10.516
with other research groups.

00:27:10.516 --> 00:27:13.116
We say, come in and use our data

00:27:13.116 --> 00:27:17.276
and ask new questions
that we don’t even think to ask.

00:27:17.316 --> 00:27:21.596
Because we have this treasure trove
of information about thousands of lives.

00:27:21.996 --> 00:27:27.756
And then we're going to make it
publicly available on public websites,

00:27:27.756 --> 00:27:29.676
because, you know, much of our work

00:27:29.716 --> 00:27:32.156
has been funded by the federal government,